      "note": [
        "In the figures for Sweden Region Gotland is excluded.",
        "Data concerning the most recent financial year are preliminary until the publication that takes place in August/September. After that, data for the most recent financial year, as well as data for older years, should be considered as final.  \r\n  \r\nFor more information about this year´s planned publications, see the publication calendar.",
        "In investment expenditure in tangible assets is also intangible assets included in the year 2007–2011. From 2012 only tangible is included.  From 2012 the variable Medical technology information system was included in the sheet.",
        "As of 2023, two new variables have been added: 'Investment expenditure in intangible assets, there of internally generated' and 'Investment expenditure in intangible assets, there of acquired'. This means that values for the years 2007-2022 are missing. At the same time, the variable 'Investment expenses in intangible assets, there of medical information systems' has been removed. Historical data for the deleted variable can be found under the heading 'Old tables, not updated'."
